 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Noticing how the guests chose the places of honor",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He told them a parable to guide their hearts",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When you are invited to a wedding feast",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not take the place of honor for safety",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For someone more distinguished may have been invited",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the host will ask you to give this man your place",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go and take the lowest place instead",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So the host can say friend move up to a better place",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will be honored in front of all the guests",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever exalts himself will be humbled",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you take the highest seat with pride",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The shame of moving down will be your fate",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But if you sit low with humility",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The host will call you up with grace",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Friend move up to a better place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your honor will be seen by all",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go and take the lowest place instead",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So the host can say friend move up to a better place",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will be honored in front of all the guests",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever exalts himself will be humbled",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.39,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The one who humbles himself will be exalted",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.56,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the truth that Jesus said",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Choose the lowest seat to find your worth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.88,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
